delete.description:
Permanently remove an alarm record (e.g. test residue or bad data).

SYSTEM_ADMIN only — normal operational flow is ack/inhibit/auto-clear;
deletion erases history, so it is audited.

post.description:
Upload IEC104 IO List CSV → validate → generate 5 config CSVs.

Returns:
  200: { "status": "ok", "summary": {...}, "warnings": [...] }
  422: { "detail": "Validation failed", "errors": [...] }
